# Ignore private local material during ordinary adds. Forced adds can bypass these
# rules; review staged paths. The local hook scans staged content with Gitleaks.

# Publish only the normal root README. Keep agent notes, research, handoffs,
# planning/specification documents and extra READMEs local. Automated *.spec.ts
# tests are source code and remain eligible.
*.[mM][dD]
*.[mM][dD][xX]
*.[mM][aA][rR][kK][dD][oO][wW][nN]
*.[rR][sS][tT]
*.[aA][dD][oO][cC]
[rR][eE][aA][dD][mM][eE]
[rR][eE][aA][dD][mM][eE].*
[dD][oO][cC]/
[dD][oO][cC][sS]/
[pP][lL][aA][nN]/
[pP][lL][aA][nN][sS]/
[pP][lL][aA][nN][nN][iI][nN][gG]/
[sS][pP][eE][cC]/
[sS][pP][eE][cC][sS]/
[sS][pP][eE][cC][iI][fF][iI][cC][aA][tT][iI][oO][nN][sS]/
!/README.md

# Dotenv and local environment. Sanitized templates stay tracked.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.sample
!.env.template
*.env
.envrc

